+# 10. Failure Policy
+
+## UI process fails
+
+```text
+UI unavailable
+memory remains healthy
+activity continues in AuditJournal
+restart UI → replay retained activity + snapshot
+```
+
+## SSE connection fails
+
+```text
+browser reconnects with Last-Event-ID
+retained history available → replay
+history gone → explicit gap + snapshot resync
+```
+
+## AuditJournal backpressure/drop
+
+```text
+authoritative memory continues
+metric/drop count increments
+live tracker shows observability degradation when status detects it
+snapshot remains authoritative
+```
+
+## Memory degraded
+
+```text
+UI shows DEGRADED
+must not invent nodes or empty state
+```
+
+## Remote unavailable after prior hydration
+
+```text
+UI shows REMOTE_PENDING / UNAVAILABLE
+local factual graph remains visible
+must not label task cross-Codespace durable
+```
+
+## Fresh runtime hydration fails
+
+```text
+UI shows hydration failure
+must not present an empty graph as confirmed new memory
+```
+
